# AgentUIServer type contract (`server/types.ts`)

This package is the **sole owner** of server-port types (`AgentChatServer`,
`AgentBuilderServer`, catalog ports, DTOs, and stream/session events in
`events.ts`). Downstream host apps must re-export these types — they must not
fork a parallel `types.ts`.

Only declare types/fields the runtime or UI actually reads or writes.
Everything else belongs on the host via `T extends Base` generics.

**All types in this surface should be generic** (or parameterize the ports that carry them) so hosts can widen DTOs, mounts, catalog rows, session/request shapes, and turn types without forking the FE contract.

## Rules

- Base interfaces are FE-minimal (`AgentSpec`, `Session`, selector entries, turn DTOs, catalog settings rows).
- Prefer generics on every extensible type / server port (`TSpec`, `TSession`, `TModel`, …) — do not hardcode host shapes.
- Host-specific fields (`fqn`, `tfyMetadata`, pricing, `modelId`, `properties`, etc.) go on host types — never on the SDK base. `AgentSpec.config` owns only capability branches shared UI reads; hosts widen it with the config generic.
- Opaque mounts stay `object` (`SkillMount` / `McpServerMount`); hosts intersect concrete shapes.
- Chat (`AgentChatServer`), builder (`AgentBuilderServer`), and catalog (`CatalogServer` / `ModelCatalogServer` / `ConnectorCatalogServer`) share this principle.
- Compose via `AgentUIServerPort` (`chat & builder & { catalog? }`); settings use the nested `catalog` field. Host-facing alias: `AgentUIServer`.
- Keep host-stable aliases (`ModelSelection`, `SandboxProvider*`, etc.) next to canonical names so UI re-exports stay thin.
- Catalog FE bases encode UI display + CRUD ids only (`ModelEntry`, `ModelProviderBase`, `ToolBase`, `ConnectorBase`).
- Harness / backend wire shapes live outside this package; hosts own those adapters.
- No dependency on `truefoundry-gateway-sdk` in `server/types.ts`.
- Catalog DTO keys are camelCase (FE surface); host adapters map snake_case wire payloads.

## Host pattern (reference)

```typescript
// ✅ host widens model/skills/mcp/config via AgentSpec type params + extra fields
export interface TfyAgentSpec
  extends AgentSpec<GatewayModel, TfySkillMount, TfyMcpServerMount, TruefoundryGatewayApi.RuntimeConfig> {
  messages?: TruefoundryGatewayApi.AgentSpecUserMessage[];
}

// ✅ catalog: FE base + host fields; map from host/harness wire types outside this package
export interface HostModelEntry extends ModelEntry {
  modelId: string;
}

// ❌ don't put gateway-only / harness wire fields on CatalogServer bases in server/types.ts
// ❌ don't redefine these ports in a host SDK — re-export only
```
